Yeah.

27
00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:53.484
Welcome to Greenland.

28
00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:54.317
Thank you.

29
00:00:54.317 --> 00:00:56.640 line:15%
Next it was time to take my offer to buy Greenland

30
00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:57.712 line:15%
