32
00:00:58.830 --> 00:00:59.663
Hello.

33
00:00:59.663 --> 00:01:00.496
Hello Mr. O'Brien.

34
00:01:00.496 --> 00:01:01.329
How are you?

35
00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:02.162
Pele Broberg.

36
00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.980 line:15%
As you know, our president, Trump,

37
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:07.630 line:15%
would like to purchase Greenland

38
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:10.110
and make it part of the United States.

39
00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:14.140
I am here to facilitate the negotiation.

40
00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.480
Tell me, how do we make this happen?

41
00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.360
If anybody is to sell Greenland,

42
00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.620
it's Greenlanders and Greenland, not Denmark.

43
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.850
So, I thank you very much for coming to the right place,

44
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.747
at least.

45
00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:28.350
The second part of it, we haven't advertised the property

46
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.847
on any listings yet.

47
00:01:29.847 --> 00:01:32.370
I did take care of that this morning.

48
00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:33.203
Oh, you did?

49
00:01:33.203 --> 00:01:35.760
I went to a local real estate office, here in Nuuk.

50
00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.707 line:15%
Our president has made a serious offer on this country.

51
00:01:39.707 --> 00:01:42.860
$1 trillion is the number we're talking about.

52
00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.730
The commission is 6%.

53
00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:45.933
I will split it with you.

54
00:01:45.933 --> 00:01:49.700
It's 30 billion for you, 30 billion for me.

55
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.239
Okay, you don't have to make another sale this year.

56
00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:54.156
30 billion.

57
00:01:55.142 --> 00:01:58.142
(audience laughing)

58
00:01:59.017 --> 00:02:01.825
(audience applauds)

59
00:02:01.825 --> 00:02:03.005
Pleasure doing business with you.

60
00:02:03.005 --> 00:02:03.838
Welcome.

61
00:02:03.838 --> 00:02:05.220
Greenland is now for sale.

62
00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.370
As a member of parliament,
Yes.

63
00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:10.020
You do have power, you do have the ability

64
00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.710
to make things happen,

65
00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:15.470
and I'm prepared right now to hand over

66
00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:18.020
