67
00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:21.960
Fall is coming and the pumpkin spice latte mocha

68
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.250
will be available.

69
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:24.880
I'd also like to show you I'm serious

70
00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.483
and brought a special gift.

71
00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:34.870
This is 120 thousand US dollars.

72
00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.660
This is not my money.

73
00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.156
I don't want to tell you where I got this money.

74
00:02:39.156 --> 00:02:40.060
Okay?
I can imagine.

75
00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:43.530
Let's just say I borrowed it from some very bad people.

76
00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.967
And you did of course pay taxes importing it to Greenland.

77
00:02:47.905 --> 00:02:49.049
(audience laughing)

78
00:02:49.049 --> 00:02:50.248
That's another thing I'd like to talk to you about.

79
00:02:50.248 --> 00:02:51.600
Okay.

80
00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.740
I took this into the country, illegally.

81
00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.503
I put myself in great jeopardy.

82
00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.841
I'm gonna leave this here for you.

83
00:02:58.841 --> 00:03:00.727
I would like the suitcase back

84
00:03:00.727 --> 00:03:04.681
