85
00:03:04.681 --> 00:03:06.510
Do we have a deal?

86
00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:07.613
No.

87
00:03:07.613 --> 00:03:09.373
This is harder than I thought it was going to be.

88
00:03:09.373 --> 00:03:12.370 line:15%
This is Malene Rasmussen

89
00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.090 line:15%
