91
00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:19.760
That's incredible.

92
00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.110
So young to have seized power.

93
00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.320
Good for you.

94
00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:26.480
You are the AOC of Greenland.

95
00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.010
Yeah.
That's very cool.

96
00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:29.770
What would you like to do for Greenland?

97
00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:34.450
Get the youth Greenlanders, care more about politics.

98
00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.610
It's an issue too, in the United States

99
00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.029
