114
00:04:02.473 --> 00:04:04.830
Yeah.

115
00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.330
That's the most insulting thing anyone's ever said to me.

116
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.250
Look.

117
00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.713
Please, here.

118
00:04:10.821 --> 00:04:14.080
I will give you this money if you hang up

119
00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.513
