120
00:04:16.372 --> 00:04:17.205
No.

121
00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:19.967
Unbelievable.

122
00:04:19.967 --> 00:04:21.270
Hey, this is Kim.

123
00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:22.410
How you doing Kim?

124
00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:23.243
Oh, great.

125
00:04:23.243 --> 00:04:24.620
You live here in Nuuk?

126
00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.580
Well, I'm born and raised up in Sisimiut

127
00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.220
