128
00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.053
Okay.

129
00:04:30.053 --> 00:04:30.900
With plane.
Oh.

130
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.510
We don't have roads between the cities here.

131
00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.560
I've noticed that there's no roads between the cities.

132
00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.330
The only way you can get from one place to the other

133
00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:38.180
