137
00:04:41.259 --> 00:04:43.150
Well, it's the Arctic, like Arnold Schwarzenegger says,

138
00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:45.040
"It's the Arctic."

139
00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.602
Yeah, yeah.

140
00:04:46.602 --> 00:04:47.800
That was a pretty good Arnold Schwarzenegger.

141
00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.633
Oh, yeah.

142
00:04:48.633 --> 00:04:49.466
Yeah.

143
