I've been learning that for a long time.

144
00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:54.140
Yeah, actually yours is almost too audible.

145
00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.699
You know what I mean, you gotta mess it up.

146
00:04:55.699 --> 00:04:56.832
It's the Arctic.

147
00:04:56.832 --> 00:04:57.679
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

148
00:04:57.679 --> 00:04:58.512
Get to the chopper.

149
00:04:58.512 --> 00:04:59.770
Get to the chopper.

150
00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:00.603
That's pretty good.

151
00:05:00.603 --> 00:05:01.436
Try it again.

152
00:05:01.436 --> 00:05:02.627
Get to the chopper.

153
00:05:02.627 --> 00:05:03.460
Now give it more.

154
00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:04.293
Get to the chopper.

155
00:05:04.293 --> 00:05:05.237
Get to the chopper.

156
00:05:05.237 --> 00:05:07.172
Get to the chopper.

157
00:05:07.172 --> 00:05:08.005
No.

158
00:05:08.005 --> 00:05:08.838
No.

159
00:05:08.838 --> 00:05:09.671
No.

160
00:05:09.671 --> 00:05:11.190
No. No.

161
00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.300
What do you do Kim?

162
00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:13.420
Well I'm an artist.

163
00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.970
I carve walrus tusk and all that stuff

164
00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:17.930
