165
00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.180
Oh, wow, that's so cool.

166
00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.250
You probably read on the news that President Trump

167
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.500
is interested in buying Greenland.

168
00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.493
What do you think of that?

169
00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:28.230
I'm getting the vibe that most people are happy

170
00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:29.240
