171
00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:30.073
Yeah, they are.

172
00:05:30.073 --> 00:05:32.560
Yes, we don't have wars, we don't have like,

173
00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.880
huge politician issues with the other parts of the world.

174
00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.131
Right, you're just a happy guy carving some walrus tusk.

175
00:05:39.131 --> 00:05:39.964
(laughs) Yeah.

176
00:05:39.964 --> 00:05:40.797
Right.

177
00:05:40.797 --> 00:05:42.740
Want to meet later on and have a little red wine?

178
00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.573
Carve some walrus tusk?

179
00:05:43.573 --> 00:05:44.960
Well, it depends on my wife.

180
00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.170
She'll kill you or something like that.

181
00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:48.980
