182
00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.870
Oh, you're wife is good with weapons?

183
00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.703
Oh yeah.

184
00:05:51.703 --> 00:05:52.536
Yeah.

185
00:05:52.536 --> 00:05:55.603
Well, I proposed to her when she got her first musk ox.

186
00:05:56.497 --> 00:05:58.010
Boom.
You proposed to your wife

187
00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.950
