188
00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:00.783
Yeah, exactly.

189
00:06:00.783 --> 00:06:02.360
And you said.

190
00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.210
On my knees.

191
00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.600
On your knees, "Will you marry me?"

192
00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:05.520
Yeah.

193
00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.573
