195
00:06:10.783 --> 00:06:12.093
I made the ring.

196
00:06:12.093 --> 00:06:13.350
You made the ring?

197
00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.830
Was it made out of walrus tusk?

198
00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:15.663
Boom.

199
00:06:15.663 --> 00:06:18.770
So, you knew it was love when she killed a musk ox.

200
00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.260
More than love, that's where you find out

201
00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:22.700
more than love.

202
00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:23.533
Right.

203
00:06:23.533 --> 00:06:24.510
I didn't know there was more than love.

204
00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.399
Exactly.

205
00:06:25.399 --> 00:06:26.550
(audience laughing)

206
00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.350
I felt that way when my wife knew our Netflix

207
00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:30.346
