208
00:06:30.346 --> 00:06:32.020
(Kim laughing)

209
00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.458
That's the American equivalent.

210
00:06:33.458 --> 00:06:36.030
That's when I knew this was the woman for me.

211
00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:36.863
You know?

212
00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:39.933
So, in a way, you and I are the same guy, aren't we?

213
00:06:40.819 --> 00:06:42.141
I don't know.

214
00:06:42.141 --> 00:06:43.568
(audience laughing)

215
00:06:43.568 --> 00:06:44.570
Sure, why not?

216
00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.900
Do you think I can make it here in this country?

217
00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:48.343
Do I seem man enough to you?

218
00:06:49.764 --> 00:06:52.739
(audience laughing)

219
00:06:52.739 --> 00:06:56.390
(audience laughing)

220
00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.650
Yeah, it's all good.

221
00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.648
You could.

222
00:06:58.648 --> 00:06:59.920
Well this is exciting.

223
00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.140
Three high school students just approached me

224
00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.220
