227
00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.213
Is that correct gentlemen?

228
00:07:10.213 --> 00:07:11.046
Yes.

229
00:07:11.046 --> 00:07:12.180
And your names are?

230
00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.134
Liam.
Liam.

231
00:07:13.134 --> 00:07:14.500
Kasden.
Kasden.

232
00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.566
And Nojus.

233
00:07:15.566 --> 00:07:16.399
Nojus?

234
00:07:16.399 --> 00:07:17.710
Nojus, it's Lithuanian.
Okay.

235
00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.218
I'm having a hard time with names here.

236
00:07:19.218 --> 00:07:21.033
So, I'm going to call you Schluden, Duden, and Luden.

237
00:07:21.033 --> 00:07:25.210
Okay, Schulden, Duden, Luden, Luden, Schluden, Duden.

238
00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.030
I just switched them interchangeably.

239
00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:28.710
You can call me Schteivy.

240
00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:29.543
Let's begin.

241
00:07:29.543 --> 00:07:30.540
What are your questions?

242
00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.180
Do you think that it's disrespectful

243
00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:35.230
that Trump comes with this offer to buy Greenland?

244
00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.860
It's never disrespectful.

245
00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.960
He is a real estate genius.

246
00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:43.220
This man managed to open casinos in a very profitable area,

247
00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.230
where people love to gamble and they fail.

248
00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.970
That's very hard to do.

249
00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:49.138
This man knows what he's doing, okay.

250
00:07:49.138 --> 00:07:51.510
I don't like most of Trump's ideas.

251
00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:53.130
I think this one might be a good one.

252
00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:54.290
I love Greenland.

253
00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.780
We should have Greenland.

254
00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.840
Wouldn't you like to have McDonald's?

255
00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.060
It would be nice.

256
00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.470
Would you like McDonald's?

257
00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.900
Okay, would you like Arby's?

258
00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:02.733
I would.

259
00:08:02.733 --> 00:08:04.047
