262
00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.690
I don't think Trump's being disrespectful.

263
00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:11.730
All he's saying is I want to buy your country.

264
00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:12.967
If I came to you right now and said,

265
00:08:12.967 --> 00:08:14.540
"Hey, I love your hat, I want to buy it."

266
00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:15.543
Are you insulted?

267
00:08:17.137 --> 00:08:18.400
No.
No, you're not.

268
00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.630
See?
I see.

269
00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.060
Yeah, yeah.

270
00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.440
Yes. If you don't mind, I'd like to make a gift to you.

271
00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.837
I'd like to change the hat you're wearing now for this hat,

272
00:08:26.837 --> 00:08:28.637
"Make America Greenland also."

273
00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.218
(audience applauds)

274
00:08:32.218 --> 00:08:33.755
It should be America great.

275
00:08:33.755 --> 00:08:36.755
(audience applauds)

